WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:02.056
- So, what do Jews believe
happens when you die?

00:00:03.046 --> 00:00:03.936
- Um,

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.341
I think it's like,

00:00:05.341 --> 00:00:07.221
we believe in heaven,

00:00:07.221 --> 00:00:09.090
but we don't necessarily believe in hell.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.818
So, I guess it's like
everyone goes to heaven.

00:00:11.818 --> 00:00:12.957
That doesn't make sense.

00:00:12.957 --> 00:00:14.279
- You ordered a sandwich?

00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:15.232
On Passover?

00:00:15.232 --> 00:00:16.891
- Oh, oops. (chuckles)

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:18.737
- You're not having any lox on your bagel.

00:00:18.737 --> 00:00:19.933
- I don't really like lox.

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:21.197
- I've never heard of that.

00:00:21.197 --> 00:00:22.614
- I guess it's like...

00:00:22.614 --> 00:00:24.762
you live on through your grandkids,

00:00:24.762 --> 00:00:26.260
or maybe just your kids.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.024
- You know you're supposed
to use the shamash, right?

00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:30.439
- Is that a ham sandwich?

00:00:30.439 --> 00:00:31.704
- Yeah, it's ham and cheese.

00:00:31.704 --> 00:00:33.039
- Ham and cheese?

00:00:33.039 --> 00:00:35.000
- Come on, have a taste.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.415
- Is that the kippot from my bar mitzvah?

00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:39.900
- So, you're Jewish, but you don't,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.757
you're not a practicing Jew?

00:00:41.757 --> 00:00:43.441
- Ah, that's so sweet.

00:00:43.441 --> 00:00:44.520
What is this?

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.542
- It's Manischewitz!

00:00:45.542 --> 00:00:47.179
- A couple months ago, when
I was home for Christmas--

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:48.201
- Christmas?

00:00:48.201 --> 00:00:52.792
(reciting blessings)

00:00:56.907 --> 00:00:58.009
- [Voiceover] Do you have a bar mitzvah?

00:00:58.009 --> 00:00:59.170
- No, I chose not to do that.

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:01.341
- You chose not to have a...

00:01:01.341 --> 00:01:04.003
huge party with all your friends there?

00:01:04.003 --> 00:01:06.428
DJ, catered food?

00:01:06.428 --> 00:01:07.787
- And what are you giving Bernie?

00:01:07.787 --> 00:01:08.809
- Give him like 20 bucks.

00:01:08.809 --> 00:01:10.689
- You don't know about 18, 36?

00:01:10.689 --> 00:01:12.826
- You should be going to Greenblatt's.

00:01:12.826 --> 00:01:13.699
- Greenblatt's?

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:14.478
- Yes.

00:01:14.478 --> 00:01:16.387
- So, you know about Jewish delis...

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.680
but you don't know about
the Jewish afterlife?

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:21.002
- I'm thinking I may
name my son after you.

00:01:21.002 --> 00:01:22.720
- How could you name your son after me?

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:23.962
I'm not even dead yet!

00:01:23.962 --> 00:01:25.483
- This is so good!

00:01:25.483 --> 00:01:27.479
- Should I get you an Uber?

00:01:27.479 --> 00:01:28.883
- Are you still seeing that shiksa?

00:01:28.883 --> 00:01:29.859
- What?

00:01:29.859 --> 00:01:30.742
- The Gentile girl.

00:01:30.742 --> 00:01:31.438
- We broke up.

00:01:31.438 --> 00:01:32.378
- Oh, that's good.

00:01:32.378 --> 00:01:33.144
- Hey mom.

00:01:33.144 --> 00:01:33.876
Hey mom.

00:01:33.876 --> 00:01:34.758
- Hi, how are you?

00:01:34.758 --> 00:01:36.140
- Mom, Uncle Seymour says hi.

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:38.020
No, no, I'm not hurt, I'm just on a date.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:39.379
- Yes, he's lost weight.

00:01:39.379 --> 00:01:40.957
- You should tell her I'm Jewish.

00:01:40.957 --> 00:01:41.962
- I'm not gonna tell her you're...

00:01:41.962 --> 00:01:43.714
(chatter on phone)
Yes, she's Jewish.

00:01:43.714 --> 00:01:44.898
- I've gained weight.

00:01:44.898 --> 00:01:45.978
Yeah.

00:01:45.978 --> 00:01:46.953
- Love you, too.

00:01:46.953 --> 00:01:47.917
- Hey mom.

00:01:47.917 --> 00:01:49.613
- All right, mom, okay, I gotta get off.

00:01:49.613 --> 00:01:50.610
Okay, all right.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.736
All right.

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:54.059
- So, you're more like Jew-ISH.

00:01:54.059 --> 00:01:56.693
- Really just Jew-ISH.

00:01:56.693 --> 00:01:57.773
- Just Jew--

00:01:57.773 --> 00:01:59.131
- Jew-ISH.

00:01:59.131 --> 00:02:00.872
- Yeah. (chuckles)

00:02:00.872 --> 00:02:02.173
- Happy Hanukkah!

00:02:02.173 --> 00:02:03.437
- Yeah, man, make a wish!

00:02:07.937 --> 00:02:09.666
And what a Hanukkah it's been.

